Summary of the terms (this section is a plain-language overview only —
the full legal text linked above is what governs):

  - You may share and download the translation for personal,
    non-commercial use.
  - You must credit the translator (gvneshv) and link back to this
    repository (https://github.com/gvneshv/Localizations) wherever the
    translation is shared or used.
  - You may not use the translation for commercial purposes.
  - You may not distribute a modified, re-timed, or otherwise altered
    version of the translation. If you need a change (a correction, a
    different frame rate, etc.), please open an issue or get in touch
    instead of redistributing an edited copy.

