This license applies only to the translation text and subtitle files
created for this repository. It does NOT grant any rights to the
underlying movies, games, or other source works being translated — all
rights to those remain with their original copyright holders. This
repository does not host or distribute any such source material (video,
audio, or original game files), only the translated subtitle text.

Future localization projects for games, if added to this repository,
may be released under different, project-specific terms, noted in that
project's own README, due to the additional constraints imposed by the
terms of service of the software being localized.
